OL,3,AFour flights targeted by suspected bomb
OL,4,Athreats land at European airports
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour flights have landed at European
OL,7,Fairports after being targeted by
OL,8,Fsuspected bomb threats
OL,10,FTwo flights were inspected in Warsaw,
OL,11,Fincluding one that set off from
OL,12,FHeathrow
OL,14,FAnother plane that set off from
OL,15,FManchester was inspected in Murcia in
OL,16,FSpain, while local media in Bulgaria
OL,17,Freported a plane landed in Sofia after
OL,18,Fa threat
